OL,3,GNEWSATravel disrupted and part of
OL,4,ABrighton's West Pier collapses as Storm
OL,5,AAusten batters UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Cornwall, Hannah Dawson-Turk says
OL,8,Fshe and her family were evacuated from
OL,9,Fa Perranporth holiday park yesterday
OL,10,Fafternoon, adding: "The night before
OL,11,Flast, it sounded like our caravan was
OL,12,Fgoing to be ripped apart"
OL,14,FGreat Western Railway (GRW) warns of
OL,15,Fdisruption due to fallen trees on
OL,16,Fseveral train lines in Devon and
OL,17,FCornwall, while Network Rail Scotland
OL,18,Fsays trains will be slowed down along
OL,19,Fparts of the West and East coast main
OL,20,Flines
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
