OL,3,GNEWSATravel disrupted and part of
OL,4,ABrighton's West Pier collapses as Storm
OL,5,AAusten batters UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,8,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,9,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,11,FEngland
OL,13,FYellow and amber wind warnings will be
OL,14,Fin place for Scotland, Northern Ireland
OL,15,Fand northern England for much of the
OL,16,Fweekend, with a yellow alert beginning
OL,17,Fin Northern Ireland from 10:00 on
OL,18,FSaturday
